{"product_id":"canal-dreams","title":"Canal Dreams","description":"\u003cp\u003eHisako Onoda, world famous cellist, refuses to fly. And so she travels to Europe as a passenger on a tanker bound through the Panama Canal. But Panama is a country whose politics are as volatile as the local freedom fighters. When Hisako's ship is captured, it is not long before the atmosphere is as flammable as an oxy-acetylene torch, and the tension as sharp as the spike on her cello . . .\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Iain Banks\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780349101712\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 198\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 126 x 196\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41763044720793,"sku":"9RB9780349101712","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/canal-dreams-123831.jpg?v=1694789911","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/canal-dreams","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}